   "description": "<p><em>You enter the saloon and see the Sheriff leaning over a glass of whiskey. He seems to be deeply troubled. You walk over to him and ask what happened.</em></p>\n<p>Oh, hello dear friend. We are entering the 19th century, and in criminal investigation nothing changes. I want to become more&hellip; scientific. I believe science can help to find, for example, a murderer. Think about examining the corpses...</p>\n<p><em>John drinks another glass of whiskey.</em><br>It's my time to try. I'm going to Jacksonville. In the last few days, four people were killed and decapitated. But I don't think I can solve the puzzle myself. Do you want to help me? Thanks, I knew I can always depend&nbsp;on you. Be ready to leave tomorrow morning. Prepare your horse, pack your food...</p>",
